TenantSage Governance Control Plane (ts_sms)

Version: 1.0 (FROZEN)
Classification: STRICT ISOLATION / SECURE ENCLAVE

The ts_sms module is the immutable core of the TenantSage architecture. It is completely decoupled from the application logic, UI, and RAG pipelines. It acts as the sole arbiter of authority, enforcing the Dual-Hierarchy (Organizational + Data) constraints, evaluating the Evidence Enforcement Boundary (EEB), and maintaining the cryptographic provenance ledger.

